[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1320.71, "timestamp": "00:22:00", "text": "经纪公司支付费用，因为他们支付了模特的费用。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1322.23, "timestamp": "00:22:02", "text": "不，是艺术。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1324.71, "timestamp": "00:22:04", "text": "。 呃，就像那种年度订阅之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1326.47, "timestamp": "00:22:06", "text": "东西。 我得付一点"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1329.35, "timestamp": "00:22:09", "text": "钱。 但后来我意识到，终身服役的成本"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1332.07, "timestamp": "00:22:12", "text": "太高了。   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1335.669, "timestamp": "00:22:15", "text": "。 终身监禁的津贴"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1339.27, "timestamp": "00:22:19", "text": "差不多有 1000 美元。 那大概有十万卢比左右吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1343.43, "timestamp": "00:22:23", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1345.99, "timestamp": "00:22:25", "text": "我当时就想，“是啊，我以后再也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1347.909, "timestamp": "00:22:27", "text": "见不到这种型号了。” 这就是我做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1350.71, "timestamp": "00:22:30", "text": "Joon 那件事的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1353.99, "timestamp": "00:22:33", "text": "嗯，即使现在，我也只有一点点钱，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1356.95, "timestamp": "00:22:36", "text": "只攒了一点点，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1361.029, "timestamp": "00:22:41", "text": "所以不行。所以我希望有一天我能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1365.029, "timestamp": "00:22:45", "text": "推出那款模型。 嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1367.99, "timestamp": "00:22:47", "text": "但至少我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1371.029, "timestamp": "00:22:51", "text": "现在有了点东西，这让我很开心。 至少是PNG格式的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1373.99, "timestamp": "00:22:53", "text": "呃，旧型号的模型因为一些原因用不了了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1376.149, "timestamp": "00:22:56", "text": "。  [笑声]"}]